ENGINE:
1. Detection - Layers marked with static=true property in Tiled are identified during _parseLayers()                                                      
2. Pre-rendering - The _cacheStaticLayers() method creates offscreen canvases (480x480px for 30x30 tile chunks) and draws all static layer tiles to them once at chunk initialization                                                  
3. Fast rendering - At draw time, static layers render as a single ctx.drawImage() call instead of tile-by-tile:                                 
  if (this.staticGroundCanvas) {                                                
    ctx.drawImage(this.staticGroundCanvas, this.worldX, this.worldY);           
  }

 Static vs Dynamic layers:                                                     
  ┌───────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┐     
  │             Static Layers             │        Dynamic Layers         │     
  ├───────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤     
  │ Pre-rendered once to offscreen canvas │ Drawn tile-by-tile each frame │     
  ├───────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤     
  │ Single drawImage() per frame          │ Viewport culling applied      │     
  ├───────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤     
  │ Zero per-frame overhead               │ Supports animated tiles       │     
  ├───────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤     
  │ For terrain, permanent structures     │ For changing/animated content │     
  └───────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────

